      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_metric_window.py` that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use AWS CloudWatch as the external provider because it is a widely used service for monitoring and observability. The integration will be identifiable through the use of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific client for CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
